<title>ITALY: Italy's 18-month CTZ auction is undersubscribed.</title>
<headline>Italy's 18-month CTZ auction is undersubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury's 18-month auction of zero coupon CTZs showed bids and allocations of 1.68 trillion lire against the 2.50 trillion lire allocated in the auction.</p>
<p>At the auction, the gross yield of the 18-month CTZs rose to 6.59 percent from 5.92 percent at an assigned price of 91.15 down from 91.75 previsouly.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
